---
import Header from "../../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../../components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "../../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../../../styles/legal.css";
import i18next, { t, changeLanguage } from "i18next";
import { Trans, HeadHrefLangs } from "astro-i18next/components";

changeLanguage("fr");
---

<Layout
  title="WiiLink - Demae Domino's Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for our Demae Domino's service"
  image="/img/branding_bg.webp">
  <Header isGuide="display:none;" />

  <div class="legal">
    <section class="section">
      <h1>
        Demae Domino's Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <h3 class="update">
        Last updated: 03/11/2025
      </h3>
      <p class="title">
        Privacy policy for our Demae Domino's service
      </p>
      <section class="section">
        <l class="notice info fullwidth">
          Looking for our main Privacy Policy?
          Find it <a href="/privacy-policy">here</a>.
        </l></br></br>
        <p class="title">Privacy Policy</p>
        <p>
          The protection and confidentiality of personal data something WiiLink
          takes extremely seriously. We believe in protecting the information
          accessed in the most secure way possible. We also believe that being
          transparent on how we access your data leads to a bigger sense of
          trust with the consumer.
          <br /><br />
          Please take your time and read through this Privacy Policy to the best
          of your ability to learn how we access and store your data. You will be
          notified through our Discord server if this document changes.
          <br /><br />
          By using the Demae Domino's service, you consent to our practices stated
          in this document. If you do not consent, please exit this page and do not
          use our services. Since this service utilizes the Domino's Pizza API, you
          are also required to agree to their Terms of Use and Privacy Policy. In
          the United States that is
          <a href="https://dominos.com">here</a> and in Canada it is <a
            href="https://dominos.ca">here</a
          >. If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, do
          not hesitate to reach out to staff in our Discord server, or by
          emailing <a href="mailto:support@wiilink.ca">support@wiilink.ca</a>.
          <br />
          <br />
          <p class="title">WiiLink Accounts</p>
          To enable use of the Demae Domino's service, you must create a WiiLink
          Account. Our privacy policy for WiiLink Accounts can be found
          <a href="/privacy-policy/accounts">here</a>.
          <br>
          <br>
          <p class="title">What do we access?</p>
          In order to use the Demae Domino's service, you must insert your correct
          personal information into the Set Personal Data channel on your Wii. This
          data is encrypted with AES-256-CBC, and is only ever on your Wii.
          Your Home Address and Postal/Zip Code are sent to us over HTTPS only when
          necessary. This includes:

          <ul style="list-style-type: square">
            <li>Requesting nearby restaurants from Domino's Pizza</li>
            <li>Requesting the price of a basket from Domino's Pizza</li>
            <li>Placing an order to Domino's Pizza</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="subtitle">Personal Data that is accessed:</p>
          <ul style="list-style-type: square">
            <li>Home Address</li>
            <li>Apartment Number (If applicable)</li>
            <li>Postal/Zip Code</li>
            <li>City</li>
            <li>Phone Number</li>
            <li>Email Address</li>
            <li>First Name</li>
            <li>Last Name</li>
            <li>IP Address</li>
            <li>Wii Number</li>
            <li>Wii Console ID</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            WiiLink never stores any of this data except your IP Address,
            Wii Console ID and Wii Number. Your Wii Console ID and Number
            are stored to validate you enabled access to this channel. All
            other data is not stored by WiiLink, however it is sent to
            Domino's Pizza in your region. Please refer to the Privacy Policy
            in your region to see how they handle your data.
          </p>
          <br />
          <p class="title">Children's Privacy</p>
          <section class="section">
            <div class="container">
              <div class="notification is-danger">
                <strong>Important!</strong><br />This service is not intended
                for children under the age of 13.
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <p>
            This service is not intended for children under the age of 13. If
            you are under the age of 13, please exit this website and do not
            access this service. WiiLink does not knowingly collect data from
            children under the age of 13.
          </p>

          <p class="title">Changes to this Privacy Policy</p>
          <p>
            It is our policy to inform the consumers to any changes to this
            privacy policy. If there is a change, you will be notified through
            our Discord server. The revision date of the privacy
            policy is at the top and/or bottom of the page.
          </p>
        </p>
        <br><br>
        <p class="title">
            Last Modified
        </p>
        <p>
            Monday, November 3rd, 2025
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
